{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo正式發售僅三天，接連有多名消費者反映內屏出現相似故障。10月25日，知名維修機構iFixit發佈iPhone Duo拆解報告，通過CT掃描、實機拆解和蘋果相關專利構建鉸鏈3D模型，試圖找出部分消費者反映的內屏開裂原因。其初步調查發現，故障可能與鉸鏈內部支撐結構有關。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583912.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.645511+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:15:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_hash":"917d3e8a9f4517cecb902c2c14882ad7f28e9546e37a833feec8b2399877aa70","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}